    "statement": "∀ {E : Type u_1}\n  [inst : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_1 : InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [inst_2 : FiniteDimensional ℝ E]\n  [inst_3 : MeasurableSpace E] [inst_4 : BorelSpace E] {V : E → ℝ} {α β : NNReal} {η : ℝ},\n  0 < ↑α →\n    α ≤ β →\n      ContDiff ℝ 2 V →\n        (∀ (x v : E), ↑α * ‖v‖ ^ 2 ≤ ((fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ V) x) v) v ∧ ((fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ V) x) v) v ≤ ↑β * ‖v‖ ^ 2) →\n          0 < η →\n            ↑β * η ≤ 1 →\n              have μ := MeasureTheory.MeasureSpace.volume.tilted fun x => -V x;\n              have J :=\n                MeasureTheory.Measure.map (fun p => (p.1, p.1 + √η • p.2)) (μ.prod (ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian E));\n              have W := fun y u => V ((1 / 2) • (y + u)) + ‖u - y‖ ^ 2 / (8 * η);\n              ∃ R S,\n                ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel R ∧\n                  ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel S ∧\n                    (MeasureTheory.Measure.map Prod.swap J).IsCondKernel R ∧\n                      (∀ (y : E), S y = MeasureTheory.Measure.map (fun x => 2 • x - y) (R y)) ∧\n                        ∀ (y : E),\n                          (S y = MeasureTheory.MeasureSpace.volume.tilted fun u => -W y u) ∧\n                            ContDiff ℝ 2 (W y) ∧\n                              MeasureTheory.Integrable (fun u => Real.exp (-W y u)) MeasureTheory.MeasureSpace.volume ∧\n                                0 < ∫ (u : E), Real.exp (-W y u) ∧\n                                  ∃ D,\n                                    Dense ↑D.domain ∧\n                                      D.IsClosable ∧\n                                        D.closure.IsClosed ∧\n                                          (∀ (u : ↥(MeasureTheory.Lp ℝ 2 (S y))) (v : ↥(MeasureTheory.Lp E 2 (S y))),\n                                              (u, v) ∈ D.graph ↔\n                                                ∃ f,\n                                                  ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) f ∧\n                                                    HasCompactSupport f ∧ ↑↑u =ᵐ[S y] f ∧ ↑↑v =ᵐ[S y] gradient f) ∧\n                                            ∀ (ε : ℝ),\n                                              0 < ε →\n                                                ∀ (f : ↥(MeasureTheory.Lp ℝ 2 (S y))),\n                                                  ∃ u,\n                                                    (∀ (v : ↥D.closure.domain),\n                                                        ε * Inner.inner ℝ ↑u ↑v +\n                                                            Inner.inner ℝ (↑D.closure u) (↑D.closure v) =\n                                                          Inner.inner ℝ f ↑v) ∧\n                                                      ε * ‖↑u‖ ^ 2 + ‖↑D.closure u‖ ^ 2 = Inner.inner ℝ f ↑u ∧\n                                                        ‖↑u‖ ≤ ε⁻¹ * ‖f‖ ∧\n                                                          ε * ‖↑u‖ ^ 2 + ‖↑D.closure u‖ ^ 2 ≤ ε⁻¹ * ‖f‖ ^ 2 ∧\n                                                            ∀ (w : ↥D.closure.domain),\n                                                              (∀ (v : ↥D.closure.domain),\n                                                                  ε * Inner.inner ℝ ↑w ↑v +\n                                                                      Inner.inner ℝ (↑D.closure w) (↑D.closure v) =\n                                                                    Inner.inner ℝ f ↑v) →\n                                                                w = u",
    "statement_sha256": "82840f4a390aaa5cadd67c774bf67a9116a9f2ceb85d8d97e90e311e15840610",
